  "title": "Brandywine Realty Trust Announces Common Quarterly Dividend, and Confirms Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "PHILADELPHIA, May 28, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Brandywine Realty Trust (NYSE:BDN) announced today that its Board of Trustees has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.08 per common share and OP Unit payable on Wednesday July 22, 2026 to holders of record on Wednesday, July 8, 2026.",
